- **Symbols / APIs:** No public, crate-visible or IPC surface is added or changed. The new symbols are test-only, under `#[cfg(test)]` in the private child module `capture::tests`:
  - `make_doc` (capture_tests.rs 17-28);
  - `#[test] render_scene_returns_the_viewport_size` (30-42, head @31);
  - `#[test] render_scene_returns_the_physical_size_at_a_hidpi_scale` (44-57, head @45).

  All coordinates are from `.andromeda/runs/2026-11-20T13-13-17-implement/new-text.md`. They call the private `render_scene` (capture.rs:81) and `RenderSize::Viewport` as they stand; `render_scene` keeps its two callers (capture.rs:48, :70).

- Gates by `run`:
  - `cargo test -p browser --locked -- capture::tests` green;
  - `bash .github/scripts/ci-leg.sh fast` green;
  - the `test -f apps/browser/src/capture_tests.rs && git diff --numstat …` probe green;
  - the `git diff -U0 … | awk …` hunk probe green;
  - `gate.py guard … --allow 'apps/browser/src/capture(_tests)?\.rs|…'` green;
  - `gate.py hygiene`, `git diff --quiet && git diff --cached --quiet && git push`, `ci.py conclusion --sha HEAD --wait 2400`, `NEXTEST_PROFILE=mutants cargo nextest run -p browser --locked` and the `cargo mutants -p browser --file apps/browser/src/capture.rs --re 'render_scene' …` entry — each `not run — leg operator`.

  Smoke: skipped — no boot-path / UI-surface change.
